{"title":"Career Roadmap · Category Executive","role":"Category Executive","summary":"A Category Executive manages the performance of a specific product category within a retail, e-commerce, FMCG, consumer goods, or marketplace business. The role sits between category management, merchandising, sales, inventory, pricing, promotions, and analytics.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Category Executive manages the performance of a specific product category within a retail, e-commerce, FMCG, consumer goods, or marketplace business. The role sits between category management, merchandising, sales, inventory, pricing, promotions, and analytics."},{"type":"p","text":"A BBA in Retail Management provides a strong foundation because it covers retail operations, consumer behaviour, merchandising, marketing, sales, inventory, and business management."},{"type":"p","text":"The most important progression is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Retail fundamentals","Merchandising","Category analytics","Pricing & promotions","Supplier/vendor management","Category strategy"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build retail, merchandising, Excel, analytics, inventory and category-management skills"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Move from Category Executive to Category Analyst / Assistant Category Manager"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Manage larger categories, vendors, pricing, promotions and category P&L"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Progress toward Category Manager, Senior Category Manager, Head of Category or Commercial/Buying leadership"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During BBA – Retail Management","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Business & Retail Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Principles of management"},{"text":"Business economics"},{"text":"Accounting fundamentals"},{"text":"Business communication"},{"text":"Marketing fundamentals"},{"text":"Consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Introduction to retail management"},{"text":"Retail formats"},{"text":"Retail value chain"},{"text":"Basic Excel"},{"text":"Presentation skills"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Retail Concepts to Understand"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Store-based retail"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Omnichannel retail"},{"text":"Modern trade"},{"text":"General trade"},{"text":"Specialty retail"},{"text":"Department stores"},{"text":"Supermarkets"},{"text":"D2C"},{"text":"Marketplaces"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should understand how products move from suppliers to customers and where category management fits into that chain."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Merchandising & Category Management"},{"type":"p","text":"This is the most important academic stage for the target role."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Category Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Category planning"},{"text":"Category segmentation"},{"text":"Product assortment"},{"text":"SKU management"},{"text":"Category roles"},{"text":"Category performance"},{"text":"Product lifecycle"},{"text":"Category growth strategies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Merchandising"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Merchandise planning"},{"text":"Product selection"},{"text":"Assortment planning"},{"text":"Range planning"},{"text":"Visual merchandising"},{"text":"Seasonal merchandise"},{"text":"Stock allocation"},{"text":"Sell-through analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Inventory"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Stock levels"},{"text":"Reorder points"},{"text":"Safety stock"},{"text":"Inventory turnover"},{"text":"Stock ageing"},{"text":"Dead stock"},{"text":"Stock-outs"},{"text":"Overstock"},{"text":"Demand forecasting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Commercial Skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vendor management"},{"text":"Purchase orders"},{"text":"Supplier negotiation"},{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"Discounts"},{"text":"Promotions"},{"text":"Margins"},{"text":"Trade terms"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Category Analytics & Commercial Decision-Making"},{"type":"p","text":"The student should move beyond basic retail operations and learn to make category decisions using data."},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Pivot tables"},{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Power Pivot"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Category KPIs"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sales"},{"text":"Units sold"},{"text":"Average selling price"},{"text":"Gross margin"},{"text":"Gross margin %"},{"text":"Sell-through %"},{"text":"Inventory turnover"},{"text":"Stock cover"},{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"Average basket value"},{"text":"Market share"},{"text":"Category growth"},{"text":"Return rate"},{"text":"Markdown %"},{"text":"Promotion uplift"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Commercial Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to answer:"},{"type":"p","text":"Why is this category growing?"},{"type":"p","text":"Which SKUs are underperforming?"},{"type":"p","text":"Which products should be discontinued?"},{"type":"p","text":"Which products deserve more shelf/search visibility?"},{"type":"p","text":"Is a promotion actually increasing profit?"},{"type":"p","text":"Which supplier provides the best commercial value?"},{"type":"h","text":"Final Year — Category Strategy & Industry Readiness"},{"type":"flow","items":["The final year should combine retail knowledge","commercial understanding","analytics."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Category strategy"},{"text":"Pricing strategy"},{"text":"Promotion planning"},{"text":"Assortment optimisation"},{"text":"Demand forecasting"},{"text":"Vendor negotiation"},{"text":"Category P&L"},{"text":"E-commerce category management"},{"text":"Marketplace analytics"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"Retail CRM"},{"text":"Omnichannel retail"},{"text":"Retail technology"},{"text":"AI-assisted merchandising"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Tools"},{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Target Level"],"rows":[[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Intermediate–Advanced"}],[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Advanced"}],[{"text":"ERP"},{"text":"Basic–Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Retail POS systems"},{"text":"Basic"}],[{"text":"E-commerce analytics"},{"text":"Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Basic–Intermediate"}],[{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"Intermediate"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Project Ideas"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong portfolio should contain practical retail analytics rather than only theoretical reports."},{"type":"h","text":"1. Category Performance Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a Power BI dashboard covering:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sales"},{"text":"Margin"},{"text":"SKU performance"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Category growth"},{"text":"Top/bottom products"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Retail Assortment Optimisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse 100–500 SKUs and identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"High-performing products"},{"text":"Low-performing products"},{"text":"Products to retain"},{"text":"Products to reduce"},{"text":"Products to discontinue"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Promotion Effectiveness Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Compare sales before, during and after promotions."},{"type":"p","text":"Measure:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Incremental sales"},{"text":"Margin impact"},{"text":"Customer response"},{"text":"Promotion ROI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Inventory Optimisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a model for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reorder points"},{"text":"Safety stock"},{"text":"Stock ageing"},{"text":"Stock-outs"},{"text":"Overstock"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. E-Commerce Category Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Traffic","Product Views","Add to Cart","Orders","Revenue","Returns"]},{"type":"p","text":"and identify conversion bottlenecks."},{"type":"h","text":"6. AI-Based Category Recommendation System"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a basic system that recommends:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Products to promote"},{"text":"Products to reduce"},{"text":"Products requiring replenishment"},{"text":"Products likely to become slow-moving"}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Internships should ideally be completed in retail, e-commerce, FMCG, consumer goods or marketplaces."},{"type":"h","text":"Best Internship Roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Category Management Intern"},{"text":"Category Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Merchandising Intern"},{"text":"Retail Operations Intern"},{"text":"Buying Intern"},{"text":"E-commerce Intern"},{"text":"Business Analytics Intern"},{"text":"Sales Operations Intern"},{"text":"Inventory Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Supply Chain Intern"},{"text":"Pricing Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Commercial Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Internship Work"},{"type":"p","text":"Look for opportunities involving:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SKU analysis"},{"text":"Sales reporting"},{"text":"Inventory analysis"},{"text":"Product assortment"},{"text":"Vendor coordination"},{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"Promotions"},{"text":"Market research"},{"text":"Competitor analysis"},{"text":"Category dashboards"}]},{"type":"p","text":"An internship where the student only performs store-level administrative tasks is less valuable for a long-term Category Management career."}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After BBA Retail Management, possible roles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Category Executive"},{"text":"Category Analyst"},{"text":"Junior Category Executive"},{"text":"Assistant Category Executive"},{"text":"Merchandising Executive"},{"text":"Merchandise Planner"},{"text":"Buying Executive"},{"text":"Retail Operations Executive"},{"text":"Retail Analyst"},{"text":"E-commerce Executive"},{"text":"E-commerce Category Executive"},{"text":"Inventory Analyst"},{"text":"Pricing Analyst"},{"text":"Sales Operations Executive"},{"text":"Commercial Executive"},{"text":"Vendor Management Executive"},{"text":"Business Analyst – Retail"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Category Executive Specialisations"},{"type":"p","text":"After gaining experience, the student can specialise in:"},{"type":"h","text":"1. FMCG Category Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Examples:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Food"},{"text":"Beverages"},{"text":"Personal care"},{"text":"Household products"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Fashion Category Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Apparel"},{"text":"Footwear"},{"text":"Accessories"},{"text":"Lifestyle"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Electronics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Smartphones"},{"text":"Laptops"},{"text":"Consumer electronics"},{"text":"Appliances"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. E-Commerce Category Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Marketplace categories"},{"text":"Online merchandising"},{"text":"Search optimisation"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"Digital promotions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Grocery & Quick Commerce"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fresh products"},{"text":"Packaged food"},{"text":"Household products"},{"text":"Dark-store assortment"},{"text":"Hyperlocal demand"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Beauty & Personal Care"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cosmetics"},{"text":"Skincare"},{"text":"Haircare"},{"text":"Personal wellness"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Employer Skill Matrix"},{"type":"table","header":["Employer Type","Most Valuable Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Retail chains"},{"text":"Merchandising + operations + inventory"}],[{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Analytics + assortment + pricing + conversion"}],[{"text":"FMCG"},{"text":"Category management + sales + trade promotion"}],[{"text":"Fashion"},{"text":"Buying + merchandising + trend analysis"}],[{"text":"Supermarkets"},{"text":"Inventory + assortment + pricing"}],[{"text":"Marketplaces"},{"text":"Data analytics + vendor management"}],[{"text":"D2C brands"},{"text":"Growth + category + customer analytics"}],[{"text":"Consumer electronics"},{"text":"Product knowledge + pricing + commercial analysis"}],[{"text":"Quick commerce"},{"text":"Forecasting + inventory + assortment"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Certifications are supplementary; practical category-analysis projects are more important."},{"type":"p","text":"Useful areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Retail Analytics"},{"text":"Category Management"},{"text":"Merchandising"},{"text":"Supply Chain Management"},{"text":"Inventory Management"},{"text":"Digital Commerce"},{"text":"Google Analytics"},{"text":"Lean Six Sigma"},{"text":"Data Analytics"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["For a student targeting e-commerce, Excel","SQL","Power BI","retail analytics provides a particularly useful combination."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"PG Study Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A PG degree is not mandatory for becoming a Category Executive, but it can accelerate progression into management roles."},{"type":"h","text":"Strong Options"},{"type":"h","text":"MBA"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Retail Management"},{"text":"Supply Chain Management"},{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"E-commerce"}]},{"type":"h","text":"M.Com"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Commerce"},{"text":"Business Management"},{"text":"Marketing-related specialisations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MSc"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Retail Analytics"},{"text":"Supply Chain"},{"text":"Data Analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For long-term Category Management, an MBA in Marketing/Retail/Business Analytics is particularly relevant."},{"type":"h","text":"Government / Public-Sector Route"},{"type":"p","text":"Retail Category Management is primarily a private-sector commercial career."},{"type":"p","text":"However, retail-management skills can also support roles in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Government retail organisations"},{"text":"Cooperative retail organisations"},{"text":"Public-sector procurement"},{"text":"Supply-chain operations"},{"text":"Government marketplaces/procurement ecosystems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Eligibility depends on the specific recruitment notification."},{"type":"h","text":"AI & Future of Category Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Category Management is becoming increasingly data-driven."},{"type":"p","text":"Future Category Executives will increasingly work with:"},{"type":"h","text":"AI Demand Forecasting"},{"type":"p","text":"Predict:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Future sales"},{"text":"Seasonal demand"},{"text":"Stock requirements"},{"text":"Product trends"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI-Assisted Assortment"},{"type":"p","text":"Systems can identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Products to add"},{"text":"Products to remove"},{"text":"Category gaps"},{"text":"Customer preferences"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Dynamic Pricing"},{"type":"p","text":"AI can analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Competitor prices"},{"text":"Demand"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Promotions"},{"text":"Customer behaviour"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Personalised Merchandising"},{"type":"p","text":"Different customers can receive different:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product recommendations"},{"text":"Promotions"},{"text":"Search results"},{"text":"Bundles"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Computer Vision"},{"type":"p","text":"Retailers can use computer vision for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Shelf availability"},{"text":"Store compliance"},{"text":"Product placement"},{"text":"Inventory monitoring"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The future Category Executive therefore needs to become commercially strong and data-literate, rather than relying only on traditional merchandising intuition."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A typical progression can be:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA Retail Management","Retail/Category Intern","Category Executive","Senior Category Executive / Category Analyst","Assistant Category Manager","Category Manager","Senior Category Manager","Head of Category","Business/Commercial Head"]},{"type":"p","text":"Alternative analytics route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Category Executive","Retail Analyst","Senior Business Analyst","Retail Analytics Manager","Head of Retail Analytics"]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Retail Management"},{"text":"Category Management"},{"text":"Merchandising"},{"text":"Consumer Behaviour"},{"text":"Commercial Strategy"},{"text":"Vendor Management"},{"text":"Negotiation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Retail KPI analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Commercial"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"Promotions"},{"text":"Margin management"},{"text":"Category P&L"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Assortment"},{"text":"Supplier performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Marketplace management"},{"text":"Digital merchandising"},{"text":"Conversion analytics"},{"text":"CRM"},{"text":"Retail technology"},{"text":"AI-assisted decision-making"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Business writing"},{"text":"Problem solving"},{"text":"Stakeholder management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Progression"},{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Target Position","Core Evidence"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Retail learner"},{"text":"Business + retail fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Retail/merchandising intern"},{"text":"Merchandising + inventory"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Category/analytics intern"},{"text":"Excel + Power BI + SQL"}],[{"text":"Final Year"},{"text":"Job-ready Category Executive"},{"text":"Category project + internship"}],[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Category Executive / Analyst"},{"text":"SKU + sales + inventory analysis"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Senior Executive / Assistant Category Manager"},{"text":"Category ownership + vendors"}],[{"text":"5–8 years"},{"text":"Category Manager"},{"text":"Strategy + pricing + P&L"}],[{"text":"8–12 years"},{"text":"Senior Category Manager"},{"text":"Multi-category/large-category ownership"}],[{"text":"12+ years"},{"text":"Head of Category / Commercial Head"},{"text":"Business strategy + P&L + leadership"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"For BBA Retail Management → Category Executive, the strongest positioning is not simply “retail operations graduate.” The student should develop into a data-driven category professional who understands products, customers, merchandising, inventory, pricing, promotions, suppliers and profitability."},{"type":"p","text":"The ideal profile by graduation is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA Retail Management","Retail Internship","Advanced Excel","Power BI","SQL","Category Analytics","Merchandising","Inventory Management","Pricing/Promotion Analysis","Vendor Management","a strong category-analysis portfolio."],"sep":"+"}]}]}